  "id": "reactivity",
  "term": "reactivity",
  "definition": "In EEG, reactivity means how much brain rhythms change when conditions change. In this packet, alpha reactivity refers specifically to the drop in alpha-wave activity when a person opens their eyes, a response that can be weaker with aging and in some dementias.",
